The statute's retention rule states that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-961137ae46e2e31beb127c0fbd3c0d69c25cc7ac "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. The schedule specifies that ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years before shredding[[cite:obs-a575aa8b42371ccb0cffcf4edc0650a6fd13a818 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].